# Doc tracker — Notion

Required env: `NOTION_API_KEY`.

## Operations

<!-- Harness scaffold: integration=notion -->

- Read page → `mcp__notion__getPage`
- Search → `mcp__notion__searchPages`
- Create page → `mcp__notion__createPage` (under a parent or in a database)
- Update page → `mcp__notion__updatePage`
- Append blocks → `mcp__notion__appendBlockChildren`

